=== THE WITHDRAWN FILLS, measured directly ===
  kept by the shield         n=   81  +3.93c  GAME-CLUSTERED [-7.34, +15.19]  G=17 G_eff=8.8
  WITHDRAWN by the shield    n=   41  -3.33c  GAME-CLUSTERED [-19.36, +12.70]  G=7 G_eff=4.5
  If the withdrawn set is POSITIVE, the model is selecting against us:
  it is pulling the quotes that make money and keeping the ones that lose.

=== COULD THIS HAVE COME OUT THE OTHER WAY? ===
  B posts a strict SUBSET of A's sides (1,055 of 809 withdrawn).
  A subset mean can exceed or fall below the full mean -- nothing in the
  construction fixes the sign. B > A was reachable and did not happen.
  The shield demonstrably ACTED: adverse-by-markout moved, and it
  withdrew 1,055 sides rather than 0 or all.

=== B - A : what the model adds as a SHIELD ===
  naive touch maker +1.49c   model-shielded +3.93c   difference +2.44c

